  - or is non-positive-definite (i.e. NPD)
. M_ani is the square root of the usual anistropy
  in a 2nd order tensor. It has units Angstrom^2.
. NOTE: If the su in U_iso or M_ani is zero, it may
  mean that there is no covariance matrix was available
  there to calculate it e.g. if you used a non-CIF2 file.

